lsdisplay (0.1.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Debian packaging regression fixes (from 0.1.3):
    - Install the man page via debian/lsdisplay.manpages (was missing).
    - Install README.md via debian/lsdisplay.docs.
    - Add a Debian-format debian/copyright.
    - Move the /usr/bin/lsdisplay symlink from a postinst hack to
      debian/lsdisplay.links; remove the now-unused debian/postinst.
  * Fix Maintainer in debian/control: 'Aprin' -> 'APRIN'.

 -- Guy-Marc APRIN <2026@gm.casa>  Fri, 15 May 2026 19:30:00 +0200

